  <p id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:cousins" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:cousins:m0000" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>前後表稱：「姨弟<persName id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:cousins:m0010" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">劉群</persName>，內弟<persName id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:cousins:m0015" ref="c2c_bkm_zon">崔悅</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:cousins:m0018" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">盧諶</persName>等，皆在末波中，翹首南望。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:head" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:head:m0000" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-062-jin067-wenqiao:head:m0002" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">公度</persName>，少拜廣武侯世子。</p>
